<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30984" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ningit</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ninguit</span></b> , ēbat, nxit, 3, v. n.
		Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίφει</span>; cf. nix, and v.
					<i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. A. 4, 250</span></i>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>it snows</i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ningit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 31</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3, 367</span></i>: cum ninxerit
			caelestium molem mihi, Att. ap. <i><span class="en">Prisc. p.
			882</span></i> P. (Trag. Rel. v. 101 Rib.).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b> In the <i>pass.</i>
			form: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totum istud spatium, quā pluitur et
					ninguitur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Flor. 1, p. 340, 39</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to shower down,
				scatter</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ningunt rosarum Floribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 627</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
